# Ship after work

When a pimpmydrone change is finished and tests are green:

1. Create a git commit (do not wait to be asked).
2. Push the branch to `origin`.
3. Publish with `./deploy.sh` so pimpmydrone.org matches the tree.

Do not put secrets, passwords, or private keys in the repo or in `deploy.sh`.
Use `~/.ssh/pimpmydrone_deploy` (Host `pimpmydrone` / `167.17.68.61`).
After deploy, confirm `https://pimpmydrone.org/api/health` shows the new version.
